@host = http://localhost:5199

### Health
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Default locale (Spanish is the platform default)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tenants/grace-community/branding
Accept: application/json

### Explicit locale: English
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tenants/grace-community/branding?lang=en
Accept: application/json

### Content negotiation: Accept-Language with q-values
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tenants/riverside-band/branding
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pt;q=0.9, en;q=0.8

### Unknown tenant -> 404 problem
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tenants/does-not-exist/branding
Accept: application/json

### Invalid slug -> 400 problem
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tenants/Invalid_Slug!/branding
Accept: application/json

### Tenant logo (SVG placeholder)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tenants/grace-community/branding/logo
Accept: image/svg+xml
